"Händelser visas här när säkerhetsrelaterade åtgärder sker på ditt konto."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account.html:974
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Your account is currently the <strong>sole owner</strong> of %(count)s "
"project."
msgid_plural ""
"Your account is currently the <strong>sole owner</strong> of %(count)s "
"projects."
msgstr[0] ""
"Ditt konto är för närvarande <strong>ensam ägare</strong> till %(count)s "
"projekt."
msgstr[1] ""
"Ditt konto är för närvarande <strong>ensam ägare</strong> till vart och ett "
"av %(count)s projekt."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account.html:979
msgid ""
"You must transfer ownership or delete this project before you can delete "
"your account."
msgid_plural ""
"You must transfer ownership or delete these projects before you can delete "
"your account."
msgstr[0] ""
"Du måste överföra ägarskapet eller ta bort projektet innan du kan ta bort "
"ditt konto."
msgstr[1] ""
"Du måste överföra ägarskapet eller ta bort dessa projekt innan du kan ta "
"bort ditt konto."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account.html:989
#, python-format
msgid ""
"<a href=\"%(transfer_href)s\">transfer ownership</a> or <a "
"href=\"%(delete_href)s\">delete project</a>"
msgstr ""
"<a href=\"%(transfer_href)s\">Överför ägarskapet</a> eller <a "
"href=\"%(delete_href)s\">ta bort projektet</a>"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account.html:1000
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Your account is currently the <strong>sole owner</strong> of %(count)s "
"organization."
msgid_plural ""
"Your account is currently the <strong>sole owner</strong> of %(count)s "
"organizations."
msgstr[0] ""
"Ditt konto är för närvarande <strong>ensam ägare</strong> till %(count)s "
"organisation."
msgstr[1] ""
"Ditt konto är för närvarande <strong>ensam ägare</strong> till var och en av"
" %(count)s organisationer."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account.html:1005
msgid ""
"You must add another owner or delete this organization before you can delete"
" your account."
msgid_plural ""
"You must add another owner or delete these organizations before you can "
"delete your account."
msgstr[0] ""
"Du måste lägga till en annan ägare eller ta bort organisationen innan du kan"
" ta bort ditt konto."
msgstr[1] ""
"Du måste lägga till en annan ägare eller ta bort dessa organisationer innan "
"du kan ta bort ditt konto."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account.html:1015
#, python-format
msgid ""
"<a href=\"%(roles_href)s\">add an owner</a> or <a "
"href=\"%(delete_href)s\">delete organization</a>"
msgstr ""
"<a href=\"%(roles_href)s\">Lägg till en ägare</a> eller <a "
"href=\"%(delete_href)s\">ta bort organisationen</a>"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account.html:1025
#: warehouse/templates/manage/account/token.html:187
#: warehouse/templates/manage/organization/settings.html:294
#: warehouse/templates/manage/project/publishing.html:7
#: warehouse/templates/manage/team/settings.html:60
msgid "Proceed with caution!"
msgstr "Fortsätt med försiktighet!"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account.html:1028
msgid "You will not be able to recover your account after you delete it"
msgstr "Du kan inte återställa ditt konto efter att du har tagit bort det"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account.html:1030
msgid "Delete your PyPI account"
msgstr "Ta bort ditt PyPI-konto"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/manage_base.html:12
msgid "Two factor authentication (2FA)"
msgstr "Tvåfaktorsautentisering (2FA)"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/manage_base.html:14
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Two factor authentication adds an additional layer of security to your "
"account. <a href=\"%(href)s\">Learn more about <abbr title=\"two factor "
"authentication\">2FA</abbr></a>. Once 2FA is enabled, it cannot be disabled."
msgstr ""
"Tvåfaktorsautentisering ger ditt konto ett extra skyddslager. <a "
"href=\"%(href)s\">Läs mer om <abbr title=\"two factor "
"authentication\">2FA</abbr></a>. När 2FA har aktiverats kan den inte "
"inaktiveras."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/manage_base.html:18
msgid "Recovery methods enabled"
msgstr "Återställningsmetoder aktiverade"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/manage_base.html:21
msgid "Recovery method"
msgstr "Återställningsmetod"

